":5,"released":"2019-02-28T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As she finally comes face to face with Pieter, Georgia resorts to extreme measures to learn more about Will's disappearance. Judith's return to her home brings back memories from her past, but she doesn't foresee an unexpected twist of fate.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6dvkArFZeRPZde6Zm1Pfr6U8g6e.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLVdpZG93LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE5LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.6","title":"The Spider and the Web","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2019-02-28T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Georgia and Adidja make a journey deep into the Congolese wilderness that yields unexpected consequences. Meanwhile, in the search for answers about the plane crash, Martin puts himself and Ariel ever closer to Azikiwe's dangerous path.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x0FiKVGj2TEnlyrdVoHpkF0M2pe.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLVdpZG93LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE5LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.7","title":"Will","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2019-02-28T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The search for Will takes Georgia to Rwanda. On her arrival, she prepares to finally learn the answers about what really happened to her husband, but is not ready for what she finds there.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nXkOzmp0KzUXQQQnIQW8Lf5H0O.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLVdpZG93LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE5LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.8","title":"Nigel","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2019-02-28T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Blindsided by the revelations about Will, Georgia returns to Kinshasa. But before she can right the wrongs of the past, she must contend with those determined to stop her from exposing the truth.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1wi2bMXivfHp09C57WSLhQYzrxf.jpg"}]}}